      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00003",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[3]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3,
      "endIndex": 775,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Would it be okay if we use GitFlow on GitHub for the hackathon? I think it would be useful to keep a clear commit history of our progress and later use it as part of our portfolios.\u000b\u000bThis is the git remote link: [https://github.com/umyunsang/Net-Zero.git](https://github.com/umyunsang/Net-Zero.git)  ← You can fork it to your repository\u000b\u000bFor the hackathon topic, I think we could go with the SimCity-style game concept I mentioned earlier, combined with a carbon emissions assessment model. Please share your thoughts and let me know what you think.\u000b\u000bI think i agree with it, but what should we do this define the Problem Definition ,target user, how ours prototype gonna impact the society  ← I think if we know all of this information ours prototype will be more clearer and it will help a lot in ours presentation",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00004",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[4]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 775,
      "endIndex": 957,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "\u000bCriteria\u000b\u000bI think we should focus on this first, because it’s the point if we complete this  \u000b1. Carbon footprint Impacts\u000b2. Society and community Impacts\u000b3. Climate change Impacts",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00005",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[5]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 957,
      "endIndex": 1041,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "\u000b> I’ll add several suggestions regarding this to the document in the Pitching tab.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00006",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[6]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1041,
      "endIndex": 1042,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00007",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[7]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1042,
      "endIndex": 1092,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "And this one we will get while we do presentation",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00008",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[8]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1092,
      "endIndex": 1201,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "\u000b4. Innovation and Creativity\u000b5. Presentation\u000b6. Potential and Possibility for next steps of implementation\u000b",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00009",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[9]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1201,
      "endIndex": 1224,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "\u000b\u000b\u000b\u000b\u000b\u000b\u000b\u000b\u000b\u000b\u000bAbstraction",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00010",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[10]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1224,
      "endIndex": 1361,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "\u000bThe key point of our project is that we are not trying to directly solve climate change or carbon emissions through the project itself.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00011",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[11]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1361,
      "endIndex": 1665,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "However, we believe that in order to address global carbon emissions and environmental issues, the most fundamental first step is to raise people's awareness and encourage them to care about these issues. Without awareness and interest, it is difficult to move on to the next stage of meaningful action.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00012",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[12]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1665,
      "endIndex": 1701,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "That is where our project comes in.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00013",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[13]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1701,
      "endIndex": 1944,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "We focus on accessibility by using one of the most familiar and engaging interfaces: a game. Through a SimCity-style experience, users can enjoy playing while naturally learning how their decisions affect carbon emissions and the environment.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00014",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[14]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1944,
      "endIndex": 2275,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Our goal is not simply to provide information about climate change, but to make environmental awareness part of an engaging experience. By helping users understand climate issues in an intuitive and enjoyable way, we hope to create the awareness that can eventually lead to real behavioral change and further action.\u000b\u000b1st Feedback",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00015",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[15]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2275,
      "endIndex": 2518,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "\u000bThey asked how will it return in case of the money (They want us if possible they hope us to to like the business thing \u000b\u000bHe said isnt it will be better if we have like campaign to encourage people to reduce the carbon, not just a simulation",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00016",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[16]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2518,
      "endIndex": 2519,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00017",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[17]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2519,
      "endIndex": 2857,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "SANG: I think we received this feedback because we introduced our project to the professor as just a simulation. If we explain that we are adding game elements to make it more engaging, encourage more people to participate, and naturally raise awareness about carbon emissions and climate issues, I think that would address this concern.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00018",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[18]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2857,
      "endIndex": 3138,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "As for the business model (BM), let’s think about some ideas individually and share them with each other.\u000b\u000bI think I agree with you. I dont know how to present to prof. yet, because I’m currently trying to understand our project. But if I fully understand I will talk to him again",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00019",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[19]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3138,
      "endIndex": 3303,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "I agree. I think we also need a clear typographic message that allows someone with no prior knowledge of our project to understand the core idea within 10 seconds.\u000b",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00020",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[20]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3303,
      "endIndex": 3428,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Okay let’s think about that together \u000b\u000bThe question that I want to know\u000b\u000b1. Is the data we're using real or made up/assumed?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00021",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[21]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3428,
      "endIndex": 3536,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2. Does the system update automatically when something changes, or does the user have to input it manually?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00022",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[22]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3536,
      "endIndex": 3617,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3. Are we connected to any live data source like an API, sensor, or smart meter?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00023",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[23]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3617,
      "endIndex": 3680,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "4. Are we modeling a real specific place, or a fictional city?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00024",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[24]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3680,
      "endIndex": 3713,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "To clarify how our system works:",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00025",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[25]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 3713,
      "endIndex": 4070,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.tlw3yfbv64bm",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Our data is not made up or randomly assumed.\u000bWe plan to conduct research on existing academic papers, experimental studies, and state-of-the-art sources, then collect data and emission factors that have already been studied and validated. We will preprocess this information into a standardized static dataset that our program can use for its calculations.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00026",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[26]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4070,
      "endIndex": 4354,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.tlw3yfbv64bm",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "We are not planning to use real-time data for the prototype.\u000bThe system will not be connected to live APIs, IoT sensors, smart meters, or other real-time data sources. Instead, it will process the preprocessed static dataset based on the user's decisions and actions within the game.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00027",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[27]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4354,
      "endIndex": 4593,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.tlw3yfbv64bm",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "We are not modeling a specific real-world location.\u000bConsidering the limited development time and complexity of the hackathon, building an accurate model of a specific city or location would significantly increase the scope of the project.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00028",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[28]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4593,
      "endIndex": 4947,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.tlw3yfbv64bm",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The prototype will therefore use a simplified fictional environment.\u000bFor the initial prototype, we are planning to use a basic flat terrain where users can build and make city-planning decisions. The main focus is not geographic accuracy, but demonstrating how different decisions lead to different activities, carbon emissions, and other city outcomes.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00029",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[29]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4947,
      "endIndex": 5237,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "So, technically, our current prototype is closer to an evidence-based interactive simulation than a true real-time digital twin. However, a real-time digital twin could be a possible future direction if we later connect the system to actual city data, APIs, sensors, or smart-meter data.\u000b\u000b",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00030",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[30]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5237,
      "endIndex": 5238,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00031",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[31]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5238,
      "endIndex": 5239,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00032",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[32]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Infomation",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5239,
      "endIndex": 5658,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "[INLINE_OBJECT kix.c5ootvukmxtt]\u000b\u000bI think we should call it evidence-based simulation(we are in the middle of simulation and digital twin), not Digital Twin. Because if we claim Digital Twin and the judges know what it means, they'll immediately ask what our real-time data source is and what real location we're modeling — and we can't answer that. But we can say our future direction is Digital Twin, once we connect to real city data and sensors.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00033",
      "path": "tabs.t.c1k7ch9qzi75.body.content[1]",
      "tabId": "t.c1k7ch9qzi75",
      "tabTitle": "Pitching",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1,
      "endIndex": 43,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The presentation have to be within 5 mins",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00034",
      "path": "tabs.t.tk7q00hpkfln.body.content[1]",
      "tabId": "t.tk7q00hpkfln",
      "tabTitle": "Requirement",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1,
      "endIndex": 12,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Objectives",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00035",
      "path": "tabs.t.tk7q00hpkfln.body.content[2]",
      "tabId": "t.tk7q00hpkfln",
      "tabTitle": "Requirement",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 12,
      "endIndex": 13,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00036",
      "path": "tabs.t.tk7q00hpkfln.body.content[3]",
      "tabId": "t.tk7q00hpkfln",
      "tabTitle": "Requirement",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 13,
      "endIndex": 171,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Two goals: build measurable technology to track/reduce/offset GHG emissions, and turn concepts into market-ready prototypes for industrial or civic adoption.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00037",
      "path": "tabs.t.tk7q00hpkfln.body.content[4]",
      "tabId": "t.tk7q00hpkfln",
      "tabTitle": "Requirement",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 171,
      "endIndex": 172,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00038",
      "path": "tabs.t.tk7q00hpkfln.body.content[5]",
      "tabId": "t.tk7q00hpkfln",
      "tabTitle": "Requirement",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 172,
      "endIndex": 234,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "****Evaluation Criteria (6 categories — no weights shown)****",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00039",
      "path": "tabs.t.tk7q00hpkfln.body.content[6]",
      "tabId": "t.tk7q00hpkfln",
      "tabTitle": "Requirement",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 234,
      "endIndex": 235,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00040",
      "path": "tabs.t.tk7q00hpkfln.body.content[7]",
      "tabId": "t.tk7q00hpkfln",
      "tabTitle": "Requirement",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 235,
      "endIndex": 263,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1. Carbon footprint Impacts",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
