      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 14,
      "endIndex": 921,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "\u000bThey asked how will it return in case of the money (They want us if possible they hope us to to like the business thing \u000b\u000bHe said isnt it will be better if we have like campaign to encourage people to reduce the carbon, not just a simulation\u000b\u000b2nd feedback \u000bI asked the prof. about our project. the simulation thing\u000bprof.: it kinda simple if we do the simulation, he suggest that we should call it digital ttwins instead of just simulation. the digital twins mean the real time things that we done for example today we open air con. the system gonna display how much carbon emission we produce in realtime . This is called “digital twin”, \u000bbut for me I think we are correct but we just called it wrong. the word simulation it doesnt attach the attention because the word simulation it just the simulation thing that dont have any reaction. But the prof. said the digital twin is really good for the impact ",
      "protectedControls": []
    }
